T56 implemented.

- `src/screens/GameScreen.tsx`: added optional `playtestChart`/`onExit` props. With `playtestChart`, it uses the in-memory chart directly (skipping manifest/chart load). ESC and song-end call `onExit(stats)` instead of navigating.
- `src/screens/EditorScreen.tsx`: extracted `buildChart()` (shared with export), added プレイテスト button that builds the current chart in memory and launches `GameScreen` in a fullscreen overlay.
- `src/index.css`: added `.playtest-overlay` (fixed inset-0, z-index 100).

`tsc --noEmit` and `npm run build` both pass.

